      "hint": "If a list of every InventoryItem away from its Supplier is not a screen anyone opens, declare `%%entity InventoryItem parent: Supplier` — the dictionary then drops its dashboard card and gives it a tab inside the Supplier window, linked on supplier_id. If it is a thing in its own right, leave it: a reference is the opposite on all three questions (§3.5.1).",
